      "updated": 1785878070876,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Matrix look up [Vocabulary_Size x Hidden Dimention Size]\n\nToken ID | Token String | Vector Weights (The Row in the Matrix)\n101         |  the           |   [ 0.12, -0.45,  0.89,  0.01 ]\n452        |  cat           |   [ 0.78,  0.61, -0.12,  0.94 ]\n899        |  sat           |   [-0.04,  0.32,  0.55, -0.21 ]",
