      "height": 130,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#0369a1",
      "text": "STEP 1: RAW ATTENTION SCORES\nFormula: Scores = Q × Kᵀ  (Shape: [3x4] × [4x3] -> [3x3])\n\nResult Matrix (Raw MatMul Interaction):\n[ -0.9760,  1.4988,  0.7850 ]  (T0 Query vs All Keys)\n[  0.3842,  1.9702,  1.3653 ]  (T1 Query vs All Keys)\n[ -0.3705,  1.1820,  0.5284 ]  (T2 Query vs All Keys)",
