      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "STEP 2: SCALED SCORES (Keeps Softmax Out of Saturation)\nFormula: Scaled = Scores / √d_k  (d_k = HEAD dim = 4 here, √4 = 2)\nReal Llama 3: d_k = 128 (4096 hidden / 32 heads) -> divide by √128\nResult Matrix (Divide each element by 2):\n[ -0.4880,  0.7494,  0.3925 ]\n[  0.1921,  0.9851,  0.6826 ]\n[ -0.1852,  0.5910,  0.2642 ]",
