    {
      "id": "_8sMbfSVZj_2SkvcDnrNK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -6377.57942988059,
      "y": 9055.120774169483,
      "width": 504,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#3730a3",
      "text": "STEP 4: MULTIPLY BY VALUE MATRIX (Contextual Output)\nFormula: Attention Output = Softmax Matrix × V  (Shape: [3x3] × [3x4])\nFinal Token Matrix (recomputed WITH the causal mask applied):\n[  1.1120, -0.0984,  0.7741,  0.3412 ] -> T0 = exactly V[T0]\n[  0.0357,  0.8224, -0.3656,  0.7888 ] -> T1 = blend of V[T0], V[T1]\n[  0.2463,  0.7297,  0.2357,  0.4863 ] -> T2 = blend of all three\nT0 is unchanged: with one visible token its softmax weight is 1.0",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "version": 1598,
      "versionNonce": 1207769272,
      "index": "b47",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "seed": 662477007,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "Rti9Xn0zy5hfak_ZmPnU2",
          "type": "arrow"
        },
        {
          "id": "uPlpof9Grof4VRNxpGMol",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1785876468302,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "STEP 4: MULTIPLY BY VALUE MATRIX (Contextual Output)\nFormula: Attention Output = Softmax Matrix × V  (Shape: [3x3] × [3x4])\nFinal Token Matrix (recomputed WITH the causal mask applied):\n[  1.1120, -0.0984,  0.7741,  0.3412 ] -> T0 = exactly V[T0]\n[  0.0357,  0.8224, -0.3656,  0.7888 ] -> T1 = blend of V[T0], V[T1]\n[  0.2463,  0.7297,  0.2357,  0.4863 ] -> T2 = blend of all three\nT0 is unchanged: with one visible token its softmax weight is 1.0",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.5476190476190477
    },
    {
      "id": "4l0HGU4E3eC_0WUpbVyU4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -7124.00501511157,
      "y": 8359.064895541089,
      "width": 563.0595092773438,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#0284c7",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4B",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 795808257,
      "version": 1540,
      "versionNonce": 540947384,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "6x2CsLw82crBO5gyca1OJ",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1785876468302,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. The Interaction: Matrix Multiplication (Q X K^T )\nThe GPU takes the Query matrix (Q) and multiplies it \nby the transposed Key matrix (K^T).\n    The Math: Every single query row is dot-multiplied \nagainst every single key row.\n    The Shape Transformation: If you have 3 tokens, \na 3 × 4 matrix multiplies by a 4 × 3 matrix. This outputs \na square 3 × 3 Attention Score Matrix.\n    The Result: This matrix represents the raw, unscaled \nrelationship scores between all word combinations (e.g., \nhow much Token 0 cares about Token 0, Token 1, and \nToken 2).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. The Interaction: Matrix Multiplication (Q X K^T )\nThe GPU takes the Query matrix (Q) and multiplies it \nby the transposed Key matrix (K^T).\n    The Math: Every single query row is dot-multiplied \nagainst every single key row.\n    The Shape Transformation: If you have 3 tokens, \na 3 × 4 matrix multiplies by a 4 × 3 matrix. This outputs \na square 3 × 3 Attention Score Matrix.\n    The Result: This matrix represents the raw, unscaled \nrelationship scores between all word combinations (e.g., \nhow much Token 0 cares about Token 0, Token 1, and \nToken 2).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
