    {
      "id": "yEwxPrWxSiazFne03W2pc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -7217.8813328035085,
      "y": 8906.463404872293,
      "width": 730,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#0d9488",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4F",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1427958287,
      "version": 1763,
      "versionNonce": 421661112,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "iL0b0_Yp4MkXLoXFSSQ88",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1785876468302,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. The Filter: Causal Masking (ALWAYS on, not generation-only)\nApplied on EVERY forward pass - prefill AND decode, training AND\ninference. Full worked example in the STEP 2.5 panel below.\n    * It forces all future token scores to negative infinity (-inf).\n    * After Softmax those slots become exactly 0.0.\n    * This makes the model autoregressive, and is why the KV cache\n        is valid: past K,V never change when tokens are appended.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. The Filter: Causal Masking (ALWAYS on, not generation-only)\nApplied on EVERY forward pass - prefill AND decode, training AND\ninference. Full worked example in the STEP 2.5 panel below.\n    * It forces all future token scores to negative infinity (-inf).\n    * After Softmax those slots become exactly 0.0.\n    * This makes the model autoregressive, and is why the KV cache\n        is valid: past K,V never change when tokens are appended.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
