      "index": "b4H",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 583915215,
      "version": 1293,
      "versionNonce": 1418001336,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "iL0b0_Yp4MkXLoXFSSQ88",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1785876468302,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. The Weighting: Softmax Activation\nThe GPU applies the Softmax function across each row of the \nscaled matrix.\n    * This turns the raw, chaotic numbers into clean probabilities \n        between 0.0 and 1.0.\n    * Every row now perfectly adds up to 1.0 (or 100%). It is \n        now officially a Weights Matrix, representing clear percentages \n        of focus.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. The Weighting: Softmax Activation\nThe GPU applies the Softmax function across each row of the \nscaled matrix.\n    * This turns the raw, chaotic numbers into clean probabilities \n        between 0.0 and 1.0.\n    * Every row now perfectly adds up to 1.0 (or 100%). It is \n        now officially a Weights Matrix, representing clear percentages \n        of focus.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mWFccvQyyJt0YcSVBHQIz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -7236.883649364836,
      "y": 9335.869656224431,
      "width": 780.059326171875,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#4e47e5",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4I",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 473754497,
      "version": 1452,
      "versionNonce": 1163095480,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "Rti9Xn0zy5hfak_ZmPnU2",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1785876468302,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5. The Concluding Step: Multiplying by Value Matrix (Attention × V)\nFinally, this percentage weight matrix is multiplied by the original Value \nmatrix (V).\n    * If Token 0 has a 90% attention weight on Token 2, it pulls 90% \n    of Token 2's raw semantic content forward.\n    * This final multiplication mixes all the token data together into a \n    single, context-rich vector stream of shape [Sequence Length x Hidden Dim].",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5. The Concluding Step: Multiplying by Value Matrix (Attention × V)\nFinally, this percentage weight matrix is multiplied by the original Value \nmatrix (V).\n    * If Token 0 has a 90% attention weight on Token 2, it pulls 90% \n    of Token 2's raw semantic content forward.\n    * This final multiplication mixes all the token data together into a \n    single, context-rich vector stream of shape [Sequence Length x Hidden Dim].",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
