      "updated": 1785876389333,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n## Step 2: Temporal Filtering (Last Token Slicing)\nEven though the model calculated vocabulary scores for all 1,000 token positions in parallel,\nthe model is only predicting *one single next word* at this point in time. \n\n### The Operation\nThe GPU performs a lightning-fast memory pointer slicing operation along the sequence axis.\n\n* **Python/PyTorch Logic:** `Next_Token_Logits = Logits[-1, :]`\n* **Action:** The first 999 rows of the logit matrix (representing predictions for past tokens)\nare completely bypassed and dropped from the active compute stream.\n* **Output Shape Transformation:** The matrix instantly shrinks from a 2D grid down to a single\n1D vector of shape **`[128,256]`**. This represents the raw, unscaled vocabulary scores for the\nupcoming Token #1001.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n## Step 2: Temporal Filtering (Last Token Slicing)\nEven though the model calculated vocabulary scores for all 1,000 token positions in parallel, the model is only predicting *one single next word* at this point in time. \n\n### The Operation\nThe GPU performs a lightning-fast memory pointer slicing operation along the sequence axis.\n\n* **Python/PyTorch Logic:** `Next_Token_Logits = Logits[-1, :]`\n* **Action:** The first 999 rows of the logit matrix (representing predictions for past tokens) are completely bypassed and dropped from the active compute stream.\n* **Output Shape Transformation:** The matrix instantly shrinks from a 2D grid down to a single 1D vector of shape **`[128,256]`**. This represents the raw, unscaled vocabulary scores for the upcoming Token #1001.\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "FoRSNF79uXIg9QhNRfD8W",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2251.1373501089765,
      "y": 17188.561716157583,
      "width": 1248.7964139166347,
      "height": 456,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b8o",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 511160679,
      "version": 666,
      "versionNonce": 679593672,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
